Her recommendation interview for continuing on to university is coming up in 100 days.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShe scrambles around in an effort to bring back the festival that got axed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne day, there's an ominous occurrence at the meeting after which her world begins to spiral into chaos...", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/1746f60334b954de3215727ab18cb444.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image_list", "title": "Features of This Game", "body": [{"intro": "[ Call-Out System]<br />\r\nAs the events progress, Hinata may get called out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShe will wake up to her head blanked out...<br />\r\nOnly you know what actually happened behind the scenes!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/9ac43685ad91a6a34dbf554285b42f28.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}}, {"intro": "[Numerous Tactics]<br />\r\nManipulation, sleep paralysis, docility...only to name a few.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/23ba4f1e80fa74227a74d9f106db862b.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}}, {"intro": "[Stealthily Rising Stats]<br />\r\nHinata has no memory of the sex events, yet her sex experience mysteriously continues to rise...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake sure to keep check of the Status screen!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/393eaeb389c25ff81db0b07ca22f4c27.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}}, {"intro": "[Unique Supporting Characters]<br />\r\nHinata is not the only one to fall.<br />\r\nAll the student council members get caught up in the sex traps.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRescue them and have them assist you in your cause!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/298b698ff1111d2289c942ecd5452691.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "The Game System", "body": [{"intro": "The System<br />\r\nSelect the daily actions for Hinata to take.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 'Go Out' to meet new people<br />\r\n- 'Train' to enhance your stats<br />\r\n- 'Rest' when your HP gets low<br />\r\n- 'HYP' when you want to enjoy the sex scenes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is made with Unity<br />\r\nand is designed to be played with a mouse, or with your finger for smartphone.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/89ee1348dc2e9943907e6c292b0ada24.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Numerous Places to Explore", "body": [{"intro": "Go Out<br />\r\nYou can meet new people by going out.<br />\r\nWatch out, some people may have shady motives...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlaces you can go to:<br />\r\n- Classroom, Nurse, Rooftop, etc.<br />\r\n- Park<br />\r\n- Cafe<br />\r\n- Mystery Shop<br />\r\n<br />\r\nand more...", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/b803727fac678b82f5f40f0c0b53aba6.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Sex Scenes &amp; Flashbacks", "body": [{"intro": "Sex Scenes<br />\r\nOver 60 sex scenes that can be unlocked.<br />\r\nOver 30 original graphics.<br />\r\nOver 500 differential graphics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBe prepared if you get called out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome of the situations you will encounter:<br />\r\n- Exhibiting nudity for classroom lecture<br />\r\n- Naughty play at the nurse's office<br />\r\n- Walking in the park naked and collared on a leash<br />\r\n- Getting manipulated into sex<br />\r\n- Getting bound by the coach and...<br />\r\n- Servicing customers in bunny costumes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nand more...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo for the virgin play, if that's what you're into!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01344000/RJ01343750/5146423d2a2710b9be78627fe09f7829.jpg", "alt": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]", "title": "Erosion [PC & Smartphone] [ALLDICE]"}, "position": "over"}]}], "description": "This is a simulation game where erosion invades your daily life.", "short_introduction": "This is a simulation game where erosion invades your daily life.", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01343750.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794949165}